"小型飞控，如 `mRobotics Pixracer（含 GPS 和数传） <https://store.mrobotics.io/mRo-"
"PixRacer-R14-Official-p/mro-pxrcr-r14-kit-mr.htm>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-hydrotek.rst:20
