#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-hydrotek.rst:29
#: dc92b78db62a406bb5e1b43a3f016f05
msgid ""
"This parameter file can also be loaded using the Mission Planner's "
"Config/Tuning >> Full Parameter Tree page by selecting \"HK-hydroteck-"
"Rover331\" from the drop down on the middle right and then push the \"Load "
"Presaved\" button."
msgstr ""
"此参数文件也可通过 Mission Planner 的「Config/Tuning >> Full Parameter "
"Tree」页面加载，从右中部下拉菜单选择「HK-hydroteck-Rover331」，然后点击「Load Presaved」按钮。"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-hydrotek.rst:33
#: d7a3f1690f18489f8269911471a5ab6a
msgid ""
"The parameter file above includes setting the :ref:`COMPASS_ORIENT "
"<COMPASS_ORIENT>` parameter \"4\" (Yaw 180) because the wiring was more "
"convenient if the GPS arrow was pointin backwards"
msgstr ""
"上述参数文件中将 :ref:`COMPASS_ORIENT <COMPASS_ORIENT>` 参数设为「4」（Yaw 180），因为 GPS "
"箭头朝后时走线更方便"
